en":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RerankActivityOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TDocument"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/RerankResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RerankResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TDocument"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic reranking"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { rerank } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { cohereRerank } from '@tanstack/ai-cohere'\n\nconst { ranking, rerankedDocuments } = await rerank({\n  adapter: cohereRerank('rerank-v3.5'),\n  query: 'talk about rain',\n  documents: ['sunny day at the beach', 'rainy afternoon in the city'],\n  topN: 2,\n})\n\nconsole.log(rerankedDocuments[0]) // 'rainy afternoon in the city'","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reranking object documents"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"const { ranking } = await rerank({\n  adapter: cohereRerank('rerank-v3.5'),\n  query: 'best laptop for travel',\n  documents: [\n    { id: 1, text: 'A heavy gaming desktop' },\n    { id: 2, text: 'A lightweight ultrabook with all-day battery' },\n  ],\n})\n\n// ranking[0].document is the original object, fully typed.\nconsole.log(ranking[0].document.id)","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tadapter","text":"TAdapter","level":3},{"id":"tdocument","text":"TDocument","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction rerank<TAdapter, TDocument>(options): Promise<RerankResult<TDocument>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/rerank/index.ts:152](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/rerank/index.ts#L152)\n\nRerank activity - reorders documents by relevance to a query.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`RerankAdapter`](../interfaces/RerankAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `RerankProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TDocument\n\n`TDocument` *extends* `string` \\| `object` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`RerankActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TDocument`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`RerankResult`](../interfaces/RerankResult.md)\\<`TDocument`\\>\\>\n\n## Examples\n\n**Basic reranking**\n\n```ts\nimport { rerank } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { cohereRerank } from '@tanstack/ai-cohere'\n\nconst { ranking, rerankedDocuments } = await rerank({\n  adapter: cohereRerank('rerank-v3.5'),\n  query: 'talk about rain',\n  documents: ['sunny day at the beach', 'rainy afternoon in the city'],\n  topN: 2,\n})\n\nconsole.log(rerankedDocuments[0]) // 'rainy afternoon in the city'\n```\n\n**Reranking object documents**\n\n```ts\nconst { ranking } = await rerank({\n  adapter: cohereRerank('rerank-v3.5'),\n  query: 'best laptop for travel',\n  documents: [\n    { id: 1, text: 'A heavy gaming desktop' },\n    { id: 2, text: 'A lightweight ultrabook with all-day battery' },\n  ],\n})\n\n// ranking[0].document is the original object, fully typed.\nconsole.log(ranking[0].document.id)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: rerank\ntitle: rerank\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction rerank<TAdapter, TDocument>(options): Promise<RerankResult<TDocument>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/rerank/index.ts:152](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/rerank/index.ts#L152)\n\nRerank activity - reorders documents by relevance to a query.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`RerankAdapter`](../interfaces/RerankAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `RerankProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TDocument\n\n`TDocument` *extends* `string` \\| `object` = `string`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`RerankActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TDocument`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`RerankResult`](../interfaces/RerankResult.md)\\<`TDocument`\\>\\>\n\n## Examples\n\n**Basic reranking**\n\n```ts\nimport { rerank } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { cohereRerank } from '@tanstack/ai-cohere'\n\nconst { ranking, rerankedDocuments } = await rerank({\n  adapter: cohereRerank('rerank-v3.5'),\n  query: 'talk about rain',\n  documents: ['sunny day at the beach', 'rainy afternoon in the city'],\n  topN: 2,\n})\n\nconsole.log(rerankedDocuments[0]) // 'rainy afternoon in the city'\n```\n\n**Reranking object documents**\n\n```ts\nconst { ranking } = await rerank({\n  adapter: cohereRerank('rerank-v3.5'),\n  query: 'best laptop for travel',\n  documents: [\n    { id: 1, text: 'A heavy gaming desktop' },\n    { id: 2, text: 'A lightweight ultrabook with all-day battery' },\n  ],\n})\n\n// ranking[0].document is the original object, fully typed.\nconsole.log(ranking[0].document.id)\n```\n"}
